      "description": "The top text 'this is a snakes mouth' identifies the visual entity (snake's mouth) as the subject. The bottom text 'it looks like a vagina' explicitly maps the visual entity (snake's mouth) to the textual concept (vagina), creating an analogical mapping where the snake's mouth is visually compared to a human female genitalia. This mapping is central to the meme's intent and is a form of objectification and hypersexualization.",
